---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Uses" description="Tools, hardware, and software I use." activeNav="uses">
  <div class="content">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">Uses</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Tools, hardware, and software I use for building things. Updated as things change.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="uses-section">
      <h3>Editor and Terminal</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>VS Code</strong> for most development</li>
        <li><strong>Xcode</strong> for iOS and Swift projects</li>
        <li><strong>Visual Studio</strong> (17/19/22/26) at work for C# and C++</li>
        <li><strong>Ghostty</strong> as my primary terminal</li>
        <li><strong>Mac Terminal</strong> as a secondary</li>
        <li><strong>Custom zsh</strong> profile with lots of aliases and scripts</li>
        <li><strong>PowerShell 7</strong> + Windows Terminal + WSL Debian at work</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="uses-section">
      <h3>Languages</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Python</strong> for scripting, ML, and quick prototyping</li>
        <li><strong>C#</strong> at work and personal projects</li>
        <li><strong>Rust</strong> for CLI tools and systems programming</li>
        <li><strong>TypeScript / JavaScript</strong> for web</li>
        <li><strong>Go</strong> for backend services</li>
        <li><strong>Swift</strong> for iOS apps</li>
        <li><strong>C++ / SQL / VBScript</strong> at work</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="uses-section">
      <h3>Hardware</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>MacBook Pro M4</strong> for personal development</li>
        <li><strong>Minisforum UM890 Pro</strong> (64GB) running Windows 11 and Kali Linux</li>
        <li><strong>LG 4K monitors</strong></li>
        <li><strong>NuPhy keyboard</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Logitech MX Master 3</strong></li>
        <li><strong>iPhone 15 Pro</strong> for iOS testing and spatial capture</li>
        <li><strong>iPad Pro 13"</strong> (latest gen)</li>
        <li><strong>AirPods Pro</strong> and <strong>Sony WH-1000XM4</strong></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="uses-section">
      <h3>Apps and Services</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Safari</strong> as my default browser, with Brave and Chrome as backups</li>
        <li><strong>Claude</strong>, <strong>ChatGPT</strong>, and <strong>Gemini</strong> for AI assistance</li>
        <li><strong>GitHub Copilot</strong> with Claude/Codex at work</li>
        <li><strong>OneNote</strong>, <strong>Notion</strong>, and <strong>Apple Notes</strong> for notes</li>
        <li><strong>GitHub</strong> for code and hosting</li>
        <li><strong>Claude Code</strong> for AI-assisted development</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
